<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said Wednesday it upgraded PacifiCorp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Energy Group Plc said it was in talks that could lead to a takeover bid from PacifiCorp. Energy Group is Britain's biggest electricity distributor.</p>
<p>-- PacifiCorp shares rose 5/8 to 21-5/8.</p>
</text>
